    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">WarpedSpace is a sci-fi survival adventure game set in deep space. A massive, open environment full of wonder and peril awaits you! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1537810/extras/566c9778d151b9cacceee5aabe138869.avif?t=1750598359\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Dive Into a Vast Space Adventure</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Stranded in deep space. No way back. Only forward.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Alone in the void, you must explore, adapt, and survive. Navigate vast asteroid belts, abandoned outposts, and eerie space wrecks as you uncover the secrets of WarpedSpace.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Explore the Unknown:</strong> Asteroids, gas clouds, wrecks, outposts, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Survive the Void:</strong> Manage oxygen, food, and water\u2014or perish.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Adapt &amp; Upgrade:</strong> Enhance your EVA suit and ship for deeper exploration.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Not Alone:</strong> Some lifeforms help\u2026 others hunt.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udef8 <strong>Play the Demo NOW on Steam!</strong> \ud83d\udef8<br>\ud83d\udcbe <strong>Wishlist &amp; Follow to stay updated!</strong> \ud83d\udcbe</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Tell me more</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Awoken from stasis into an unexpected and hostile environment, the traveler must explore the mysteries of WarpedSpace. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">WarpedSpace creates environments that provide opportunities to immerse yourself in a Sci-Fi world like no other. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1537810/extras/b309b7cd523245956e15f65b0ec6ab31.avif?t=1750598359\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Exploration is key in this open-world adventure and leaving the comforts of your ship to explore caves and wrecks may result in untold rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">To bring the world to life-- Creatures may find your ship more appetizing than you-- but you and your ship may not always be the most enticing items on the menu.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Organic and inorganic lifeforms with needs or goals may ignore you unless you get in their way. Not everything is out to kill you so choose your actions wisely. Encounters with hostile forces may be too much to handle so escape may be a smarter and more thrilling strategy than expected.<br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1537810/extras/c8e137ab20dd527ee07e3ea0b85aec15.avif?t=1750598359\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Being mindful of where you leave your ship will play a critical role when a quick escape is key. Masking or lowering your ship's signature will be useful when operating in more hostile areas and can protect against creatures that might be drawn to it. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore, mine, hunt, harvest, build and upgrade to survive and uncover the mysteries of WarpedSpace. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wake up, traveler. THEY are coming!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Want to make suggestions  ? </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Then join our Discord ! ( See Steam Link Section ) </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Latest Features Added :   </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Jump Gates </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Updated Ui </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mining for Ships &amp; Player Character </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tractor Beams and Salvage for Ships &amp; Player Character</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Per Environment Gravity </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Oxygen &amp; Life Support for Base Building </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">TrackIR Support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Research</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">De-Construction for crafted items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">EVA Boost VFX</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features being Developed</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Exploration</strong> Explore an open world environment on foot, EVA and in your ship. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Environments</strong> Environments range from asteroid belts, wrecks,  gas clouds, alien outposts and more. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>FPS Combat</strong> Not everywhere is safe find and upgrade a weapon or two as you explore the different environments and points of interest. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Space Combat</strong> Where Classic Arcade Meets Cosmic Exploration. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Base Building</strong> With the Recent Addition of Base Building you now have the opportunity to set up camp and live among the star. (currently being reworked)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Story</strong> Enjoy the open world or settle down it's up to you how much of the mystery you discover. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Repair</strong> Maintain your ship, you'll have to find a safe place to Eva and restore your ship to battle ready status </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Salvage</strong> Salvage material as you explore to build your base or repair your ship </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Survival </strong> Oxygen and food, fuel and more. Suggestions are welcome. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Upgrade Your Ship </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1537810/extras/37b8cc7ec9c30f2a0154674ad56839dc.avif?t=1750598359\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">See you in WarpedSpace aka Spacenautica</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1537810/extras/ff7d4cdfb3637107f62ca977f9faec44.avif?t=1750598359\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Explore the mystery of this Space Adventure</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">What happened to the planets?  Who is with you in this system? Discover outposts underground bases Alien tech and more.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">WarpedSpace is a sci-fi survival adventure game set in deep space. A massive, open environment full of wonder and peril awaits you! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1537810/extras/566c9778d151b9cacceee5aabe138869.avif?t=1750598359\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Dive Into a Vast Space Adventure</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Stranded in deep space. No way back. Only forward.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Alone in the void, you must explore, adapt, and survive. Navigate vast asteroid belts, abandoned outposts, and eerie space wrecks as you uncover the secrets of WarpedSpace.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Explore the Unknown:</strong> Asteroids, gas clouds, wrecks, outposts, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Survive the Void:</strong> Manage oxygen, food, and water\u2014or perish.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Adapt &amp; Upgrade:</strong> Enhance your EVA suit and ship for deeper exploration.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Not Alone:</strong> Some lifeforms help\u2026 others hunt.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udef8 <strong>Play the Demo NOW on Steam!</strong> \ud83d\udef8<br>\ud83d\udcbe <strong>Wishlist &amp; Follow to stay updated!</strong> \ud83d\udcbe</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Tell me more</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Awoken from stasis into an unexpected and hostile environment, the traveler must explore the mysteries of WarpedSpace. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">WarpedSpace creates environments that provide opportunities to immerse yourself in a Sci-Fi world like no other. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1537810/extras/b309b7cd52324595